Cause me for myself builds up a firewall rule by rule (understanding them and what I am doing (hopefully) too). And I have lots of comments in the file building the firewall. But nevertheless I would like to recheck everything with the -L flag and at this point (short) names for rules would be very nice to have.

So my questions all together:

    Is there a possibility like this already?

    What are you thinking about it?


